<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}</p>

<p>Hi{{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting us about our unaccompanied minor fee.<br />
<br />
We know that travelling alone can be both exciting and daunting for children, so we offer a range of services to make their journey easier.<br />
<br />
These include supervised rooms during transit at Brisbane, Sydney, Melbourne, Perth, Cairns and Adelaide Airports, and an escort through Immigration and Customs by Qantas Customer Service Agents for international flights.<br />
<br />
We take their safety very seriously and work hard to make sure they have an enjoyable flight. This does mean that we charge a nominal fee to provide these services.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If parent is in higher cabin add:</em></strong><br />
<br />
The fee also applies if the parent/guardian/responsible adult is travelling with the unaccompanied minor but is seated in a different cabin.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I’ve passed your comments on to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting us and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
